---
const sections = [
  {
    title: 'Utah Tax Planning Attorneys',
    paragraphs: [
      `Our full-service tax law firm can help you reduce taxes and audit risks. Strategic tax planning is one of the most valuable services we offer — it allows you to take advantage of all legally available deductions, credits, and timing strategies before you face a problem.`
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Why Tax Planning Matters',
    paragraphs: [
      `Many taxpayers wait until they receive an IRS notice before engaging a tax attorney. But proactive tax planning can:`
    ],
    list: [
      'Significantly reduce your current and future tax liability',
      'Minimize the risk of triggering an audit',
      'Ensure you are taking full advantage of all legitimate deductions',
      'Help you plan the timing of income and expenses for maximum benefit',
      'Protect your assets and prepare for business transitions'
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Individual Tax Planning Services',
    paragraphs: [
      `We work with individual taxpayers to develop customized plans that address:`
    ],
    list: [
      'Income timing strategies',
      'Investment tax planning, including capital gains management',
      'Retirement planning and IRA strategies',
      'Real estate tax planning',
      'Estate and gift tax planning',
      'Charitable contribution strategies'
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Business Tax Planning Services',
    paragraphs: [
      `For business owners, we address entity selection, compensation strategies, retirement plan design, and succession planning to minimize tax burden at every stage of your business lifecycle.`
    ]
  },
  {
    title: 'Year-Round Tax Planning',
    paragraphs: [
      `Effective tax planning is not just an annual event — it requires year-round attention to changing circumstances, new laws, and opportunities. Our team stays current with tax law developments and proactively advises clients on strategies that can benefit them.`,
      `Call Michelle Turpin P.C. today at <strong>(801) 685-0552</strong> to discuss how proactive tax planning can benefit your situation.`
    ]
  }
];
---

<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-4">
    {sections.map((s) => (
      <div class="mb-10 last:mb-0">
        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[30px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-4 leading-tight">
          {s.title}
        </h2>
        {s.paragraphs.map((p) => (
          <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4" set:html={p} />
        ))}
        {s.list && (
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65]">
            {s.list.map((item) => (
              <li set:html={item} />
            ))}
          </ul>
        )}
      </div>
    ))}
    <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-sm italic mt-12 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
      This content is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
